      "writtenOn": "2026-09-01T20:05:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The issue with removing the agent check is that when an agent does forget --cbr or --yes, it still hangs in vi or on stdin until timeout.\n\nthe goal is to never hang headless tools. If there\u0027s ambiguity, fail fast with copy-pasteable commands so the agent can recover.",
      "parentUuid": "13ea25bb_a5e5e575",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 453,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 469,
